[
  {
    "role": "narrator",
    "index": 1,
    "text": "苏晚在旧物回收站捡到那台老式相机时，恰逢初秋。",
    "path": "/audio/reference-voices-v1/narrator/23f7bc447d01ced9.mp3",
    "duration": 5.76,
    "elapsed": 0.0
  },
  {
    "role": "narrator",
    "index": 2,
    "text": "木质机身磨得温润发亮，镜头蒙着一层薄薄的灰，看起来被搁置了很多年。",
    "path": "/audio/reference-voices-v1/narrator/1e27a6457619d140.mp3",
    "duration": 8.365583333333333,
    "elapsed": 6.8
  },
  {
    "role": "narrator",
    "index": 3,
    "text": "老板说这是没人认领的旧东西，放了大半年，没人要，她喜欢就拿走。",
    "path": "/audio/reference-voices-v1/narrator/4741805d66c53a21.mp3",
    "duration": 7.36,
    "elapsed": 5.5
  },
  {
    "role": "narrator",
    "index": 4,
    "text": "她鬼使神差地付了钱。",
    "path": "/audio/reference-voices-v1/narrator/3cde64c5468d5533.mp3",
    "duration": 2.96,
    "elapsed": 2.8
  },
  {
    "role": "narrator",
    "index": 5,
    "text": "苏晚最近总是很累，日复一日的通勤、重复琐碎的工作，把日子过成了灰蒙蒙的单色，她很久没有好好看过一次落日，很久没有为一件小事心动过。",
    "path": "/audio/reference-voices-v1/narrator/4584f7779e44dd8c.mp3",
    "duration": 14.08,
    "elapsed": 10.4
  },
  {
    "role": "narrator",
    "index": 6,
    "text": "回家后，她细心擦干净相机，意外发现里面还卡着一张没冲洗的胶卷。",
    "path": "/audio/reference-voices-v1/narrator/cfddcc6b30314c53.mp3",
    "duration": 8.08,
    "elapsed": 6.0
  },
  {
    "role": "narrator",
    "index": 7,
    "text": "她找了老照相馆，拜托老板帮忙冲洗。",
    "path": "/audio/reference-voices-v1/narrator/70b61a64af0e46b8.mp3",
    "duration": 4.72,
    "elapsed": 3.8
  },
  {
    "role": "narrator",
    "index": 8,
    "text": "三天后，照片出来的那一刻，苏晚的呼吸骤然停住。",
    "path": "/audio/reference-voices-v1/narrator/c4fec7ff2049a8fe.mp3",
    "duration": 5.76,
    "elapsed": 4.3
  },
  {
    "role": "narrator",
    "index": 9,
    "text": "十几张照片，全是同一个女孩。",
    "path": "/audio/reference-voices-v1/narrator/512ae40adac2ebac.mp3",
    "duration": 3.76,
    "elapsed": 3.2
  },
  {
    "role": "narrator",
    "index": 10,
    "text": "扎着简单的马尾，穿着干净的白衬衫，站在老街的梧桐树下、傍晚的江边、洒满阳光的操场。",
    "path": "/audio/reference-voices-v1/narrator/a04de3d501b9ba55.mp3",
    "duration": 9.92,
    "elapsed": 7.4
  },
  {
    "role": "narrator",
    "index": 11,
    "text": "女孩眉眼弯弯，笑得干净又热烈，浑身都裹着明媚的光。",
    "path": "/audio/reference-voices-v1/narrator/6e8f4166b63d1fa8.mp3",
    "duration": 7.44,
    "elapsed": 5.6
  },
  {
    "role": "narrator",
    "index": 12,
    "text": "最让她心惊的是——那个女孩，和她长得一模一样。",
    "path": "/audio/reference-voices-v1/narrator/79c733486a4fb6d6.mp3",
    "duration": 5.44,
    "elapsed": 4.3
  },
  {
    "role": "narrator",
    "index": 13,
    "text": "最后一张照片的背面，写着一行清秀的小字：希望我的女孩，永远拥有晴天。",
    "path": "/audio/reference-voices-v1/narrator/96981b6d9f507b04.mp3",
    "duration": 7.84,
    "elapsed": 5.8
  },
  {
    "role": "narrator",
    "index": 14,
    "text": "没有署名，没有日期。",
    "path": "/audio/reference-voices-v1/narrator/9d3d6d141f331d65.mp3",
    "duration": 3.12,
    "elapsed": 2.9
  },
  {
    "role": "narrator",
    "index": 15,
    "text": "苏晚心里塞满了疑惑。",
    "path": "/audio/reference-voices-v1/narrator/18240de15eedf212.mp3",
    "duration": 3.2,
    "elapsed": 2.9
  },
  {
    "role": "narrator",
    "index": 16,
    "text": "她从小到大的照片寥寥无几，父母不爱拍照，她的青春几乎没有留下影像记录，这组明媚鲜活的照片，绝不可能是她。",
    "path": "/audio/reference-voices-v1/narrator/d043274c08969789.mp3",
    "duration": 12.0,
    "elapsed": 8.9
  },
  {
    "role": "narrator",
    "index": 17,
    "text": "为了找到线索，她按着照片里的老街地址，找了过去。",
    "path": "/audio/reference-voices-v1/narrator/1db23511bb92d27b.mp3",
    "duration": 5.52,
    "elapsed": 4.5
  },
  {
    "role": "narrator",
    "index": 18,
    "text": "那条老街还没拆迁，梧桐依旧茂盛，晚风缓缓吹过，和照片里的场景分毫不差。",
    "path": "/audio/reference-voices-v1/narrator/99167fcfd3467cc1.mp3",
    "duration": 9.44,
    "elapsed": 7.0
  },
  {
    "role": "narrator",
    "index": 19,
    "text": "老街尽头开着一家小小的书店，推门进去时，风铃轻轻作响。",
    "path": "/audio/reference-voices-v1/narrator/82b9caf1a46271e7.mp3",
    "duration": 7.76,
    "elapsed": 5.9
  },
  {
    "role": "narrator",
    "index": 20,
    "text": "柜台后坐着一个穿白衬衫的男生，眉眼干净，安静温柔。",
    "path": "/audio/reference-voices-v1/narrator/165316214913e1d5.mp3",
    "duration": 6.64,
    "elapsed": 5.4
  },
  {
    "role": "narrator",
    "index": 21,
    "text": "男生抬头，看见她的瞬间，瞳孔微微一颤。",
    "path": "/audio/reference-voices-v1/narrator/238e998bd39bf65d.mp3",
    "duration": 5.2,
    "elapsed": 5.2
  },
  {
    "role": "narrator",
    "index": 22,
    "text": "良久，他轻声开口：“你终于来了。”",
    "path": "/audio/reference-voices-v1/narrator/06d3ca5c3f5d87da.mp3",
    "duration": 4.32,
    "elapsed": 6.4
  },
  {
    "role": "narrator",
    "index": 23,
    "text": "苏晚愣住：“你认识我？”",
    "path": "/audio/reference-voices-v1/narrator/a717a93875d61c25.mp3",
    "duration": 3.04,
    "elapsed": 5.2
  },
  {
    "role": "narrator",
    "index": 24,
    "text": "他拿出一个旧笔记本，翻开，里面夹着一张一模一样的照片，正是最后那张江边的合照——原来照片角落，还有一个少年的身影，被裁掉了大半。",
    "path": "/audio/reference-voices-v1/narrator/6514b25ec6d44395.mp3",
    "duration": 13.84,
    "elapsed": 12.2
  },
  {
    "role": "narrator",
    "index": 25,
    "text": "“这是十年前拍的。”",
    "path": "/audio/reference-voices-v1/narrator/1e6e2e8819059848.mp3",
    "duration": 1.92,
    "elapsed": 2.9
  },
  {
    "role": "narrator",
    "index": 26,
    "text": "男生声音很轻，“我和我喜欢的女生，在这里拍的。”",
    "path": "/audio/reference-voices-v1/narrator/efd43bb301a20250.mp3",
    "duration": 5.36,
    "elapsed": 5.2
  },
  {
    "role": "narrator",
    "index": 27,
    "text": "苏晚指尖发紧。",
    "path": "/audio/reference-voices-v1/narrator/9a35c97c48313426.mp3",
    "duration": 2.16,
    "elapsed": 2.9
  },
  {
    "role": "narrator",
    "index": 28,
    "text": "“她和你长得一样，性格也一样。”",
    "path": "/audio/reference-voices-v1/narrator/d3304fe930ff73ee.mp3",
    "duration": 3.76,
    "elapsed": 4.2
  },
  {
    "role": "narrator",
    "index": 29,
    "text": "他低头看着照片，眼底带着温柔的遗憾，“那年她生了一场很重的病，怕自己熬不过去，偷偷拍下了所有她喜欢的风景，想留给我做念想。”",
    "path": "/audio/reference-voices-v1/narrator/a2c11daad2b4c55f.mp3",
    "duration": 13.28,
    "elapsed": 13.4
  },
  {
    "role": "narrator",
    "index": 30,
    "text": "“她很喜欢晴天，她说只要有晴天，就有希望。”",
    "path": "/audio/reference-voices-v1/narrator/fbb3aea3c62d4c1e.mp3",
    "duration": 5.76,
    "elapsed": 6.6
  },
  {
    "role": "narrator",
    "index": 31,
    "text": "苏晚心口忽然一酸，莫名的酸涩汹涌上来。",
    "path": "/audio/reference-voices-v1/narrator/f4a79d043b6f3ffd.mp3",
    "duration": 5.36,
    "elapsed": 6.5
  },
  {
    "role": "narrator",
    "index": 32,
    "text": "“后来呢？”",
    "path": "/audio/reference-voices-v1/narrator/e5c65711959ac405.mp3",
    "duration": 2.4,
    "elapsed": 3.0
  },
  {
    "role": "narrator",
    "index": 33,
    "text": "“后来她好了。”",
    "path": "/audio/reference-voices-v1/narrator/fc1ac44c069dc453.mp3",
    "duration": 2.08,
    "elapsed": 3.4
  },
  {
    "role": "narrator",
    "index": 34,
    "text": "男生抬头，看向窗外的暖阳，眼底盛满温柔，“只是她痊愈后，忘了所有关于我的记忆。”",
    "path": "/audio/reference-voices-v1/narrator/868bfbef9f851ff0.mp3",
    "duration": 10.0,
    "elapsed": 14.0
  },
  {
    "role": "narrator",
    "index": 35,
    "text": "苏晚彻底僵住。",
    "path": "/audio/reference-voices-v1/narrator/c72b4c9b5c139134.mp3",
    "duration": 2.16,
    "elapsed": 4.5
  },
  {
    "role": "narrator",
    "index": 36,
    "text": "原来不是长得像。",
    "path": "/audio/reference-voices-v1/narrator/48379da50b1acf43.mp3",
    "duration": 2.32,
    "elapsed": 3.5
  },
  {
    "role": "narrator",
    "index": 37,
    "text": "照片里的女孩，就是她自己。",
    "path": "/audio/reference-voices-v1/narrator/7d18438ec308a3cc.mp3",
    "duration": 4.0,
    "elapsed": 4.8
  },
  {
    "role": "narrator",
    "index": 38,
    "text": "十年前那场大病，让她丢失了一整段青春的记忆，弄丢了年少最纯粹的欢喜。",
    "path": "/audio/reference-voices-v1/narrator/4dfbe91b91a53abc.mp3",
    "duration": 8.24,
    "elapsed": 10.0
  },
  {
    "role": "narrator",
    "index": 39,
    "text": "这些年她总觉得生活寡淡无味、心里空空落落，总好像缺了一块温柔的东西。",
    "path": "/audio/reference-voices-v1/narrator/ab378f1e40716b11.mp3",
    "duration": 7.92,
    "elapsed": 10.1
  },
  {
    "role": "narrator",
    "index": 40,
    "text": "不是生活无趣，是她弄丢了曾经热烈热爱生活的自己。",
    "path": "/audio/reference-voices-v1/narrator/cc96a4ac251bac24.mp3",
    "duration": 5.76,
    "elapsed": 5.4
  },
  {
    "role": "narrator",
    "index": 41,
    "text": "男生把那台相机轻轻放在她手里：“当年相机弄丢了，我找了很多年。",
    "path": "/audio/reference-voices-v1/narrator/55099a0939426960.mp3",
    "duration": 7.2,
    "elapsed": 7.3
  },
  {
    "role": "narrator",
    "index": 42,
    "text": "我一直在等，等你再一次走到我面前。”",
    "path": "/audio/reference-voices-v1/narrator/d24df9663876f6bc.mp3",
    "duration": 4.48,
    "elapsed": 6.0
  },
  {
    "role": "narrator",
    "index": 43,
    "text": "阳光穿过玻璃窗，落在两人身上，温暖又明亮。",
    "path": "/audio/reference-voices-v1/narrator/184db422c9890710.mp3",
    "duration": 5.52,
    "elapsed": 6.4
  },
  {
    "role": "narrator",
    "index": 44,
    "text": "苏晚握着温热的相机，忽然笑了。",
    "path": "/audio/reference-voices-v1/narrator/1e93f025184e03fd.mp3",
    "duration": 4.8,
    "elapsed": 5.9
  },
  {
    "role": "narrator",
    "index": 45,
    "text": "这些年压在心底的疲惫、迷茫、莫名的怅然，全都烟消云散。",
    "path": "/audio/reference-voices-v1/narrator/95fcc2816f68e311.mp3",
    "duration": 7.92,
    "elapsed": 8.7
  },
  {
    "role": "narrator",
    "index": 46,
    "text": "原来她不是生来沉闷，她曾经也热烈、明媚、永远向阳。",
    "path": "/audio/reference-voices-v1/narrator/1073607ccb627f59.mp3",
    "duration": 7.28,
    "elapsed": 10.8
  },
  {
    "role": "narrator",
    "index": 47,
    "text": "原来有些温柔不会被时光抹去，有些人，会跨过漫长岁月，一直等你归来。",
    "path": "/audio/reference-voices-v1/narrator/e25d9aedea35b2f1.mp3",
    "duration": 8.48,
    "elapsed": 11.3
  },
  {
    "role": "narrator",
    "index": 48,
    "text": "傍晚的落日铺满江面，和十年前的景色重合。",
    "path": "/audio/reference-voices-v1/narrator/70d70a117b2c847f.mp3",
    "duration": 5.36,
    "elapsed": 6.2
  },
  {
    "role": "narrator",
    "index": 49,
    "text": "苏晚举起相机，对着落日，对着眼前的少年，轻轻按下快门。",
    "path": "/audio/reference-voices-v1/narrator/426663cac57e2e7b.mp3",
    "duration": 6.64,
    "elapsed": 7.7
  },
  {
    "role": "narrator",
    "index": 50,
    "text": "遗失的晴天，终于找回来了。",
    "path": "/audio/reference-voices-v1/narrator/405e61688377776a.mp3",
    "duration": 3.68,
    "elapsed": 4.7
  },
  {
    "role": "narrator",
    "index": 51,
    "text": "余生漫漫，日日是晴。",
    "path": "/audio/reference-voices-v1/narrator/0e7da15491ac86dc.mp3",
    "duration": 3.36,
    "elapsed": 4.5
  },
  {
    "role": "kanshan",
    "index": 1,
    "text": "老板，你好，我想在这里办理一件旧物的寄展。这台相机是苏晚的，她托我带来，还有这些照片。在你决定之前，我想先把它的故事讲给你听。",
    "path": "/audio/reference-voices-v1/kanshan/8c948f1b22dcced6.mp3",
    "duration": 11.840041666666666,
    "elapsed": 0.0
  },
  {
    "role": "kanshan",
    "index": 2,
    "text": "这次她委托我来办理寄展，也把这段经历告诉了我。",
    "path": "/audio/reference-voices-v1/kanshan/3d9a5f21ceb498c2.mp3",
    "duration": 5.04,
    "elapsed": 5.3
  },
  {
    "role": "kanshan",
    "index": 3,
    "text": "是寄展，东西仍然属于苏晚。",
    "path": "/audio/reference-voices-v1/kanshan/1c87d67a8f410186.mp3",
    "duration": 2.96,
    "elapsed": 3.5
  },
  {
    "role": "kanshan",
    "index": 4,
    "text": "是，十年前那场大病，让她遗失了一整段青春的记忆。",
    "path": "/audio/reference-voices-v1/kanshan/439a3b1b234b4713.mp3",
    "duration": 5.68,
    "elapsed": 5.8
  },
  {
    "role": "kanshan",
    "index": 5,
    "text": "是，他找了相机很多年，也一直等着她再次走到面前。",
    "path": "/audio/reference-voices-v1/kanshan/7259f27396c64e1a.mp3",
    "duration": 5.36,
    "elapsed": 5.6
  },
  {
    "role": "kanshan",
    "index": 6,
    "text": "她最后拍下了落日，也拍向了眼前的少年。",
    "path": "/audio/reference-voices-v1/kanshan/f53f4a99ae01b431.mp3",
    "duration": 4.4,
    "elapsed": 5.0
  },
  {
    "role": "kanshan",
    "index": 7,
    "text": "照片没有署名，苏晚没有向我明确说过是谁写的。",
    "path": "/audio/reference-voices-v1/kanshan/aa85af4d786f1a01.mp3",
    "duration": 4.16,
    "elapsed": 4.6
  },
  {
    "role": "kanshan",
    "index": 8,
    "text": "相机当年丢过，他找了很多年，但中间怎样辗转到回收站，我没有听她说起。",
    "path": "/audio/reference-voices-v1/kanshan/df9ddc4a0f694c9c.mp3",
    "duration": 8.4,
    "elapsed": 12.1
  },
  {
    "role": "kanshan",
    "index": 9,
    "text": "具体病名，苏晚没有告诉我。",
    "path": "/audio/reference-voices-v1/kanshan/ee1627ec94ff14c9.mp3",
    "duration": 2.85,
    "elapsed": 3.4
  },
  {
    "role": "kanshan",
    "index": 10,
    "text": "她认出了照片里的自己，也重新找回了对生活的热情，至于每段记忆是否都恢复了，我没有更具体的信息。",
    "path": "/audio/reference-voices-v1/kanshan/0df3374bd3a0eb97.mp3",
    "duration": 9.2,
    "elapsed": 9.4
  },
  {
    "role": "kanshan",
    "index": 11,
    "text": "他的名字，苏晚没有向我提起。",
    "path": "/audio/reference-voices-v1/kanshan/ea21c92854c58443.mp3",
    "duration": 3.04,
    "elapsed": 3.4
  },
  {
    "role": "kanshan",
    "index": 12,
    "text": "我是受苏晚委托来办理寄展的看山，这段经历是她告诉我的。",
    "path": "/audio/reference-voices-v1/kanshan/10f5c72696fd2b8f.mp3",
    "duration": 6.274541666666667,
    "elapsed": 6.4
  },
  {
    "role": "kanshan",
    "index": 13,
    "text": "她托我带来，是希望通过寄展分享这段经历，相机仍然属于她。",
    "path": "/audio/reference-voices-v1/kanshan/205162850d23e67c.mp3",
    "duration": 6.753125,
    "elapsed": 7.0
  },
  {
    "role": "kanshan",
    "index": 14,
    "text": "我知道的是她讲给我的这段经历，故事之后更具体的生活，她没有告诉我。",
    "path": "/audio/reference-voices-v1/kanshan/ad40dd0d0ac8139f.mp3",
    "duration": 7.04,
    "elapsed": 7.2
  },
  {
    "role": "kanshan",
    "index": 15,
    "text": "在这段故事里，她找回了年少的经历，也重新看见自己曾经热爱生活的样子，我理解“晴天”有这一层意思。",
    "path": "/audio/reference-voices-v1/kanshan/983fb0fe16772186.mp3",
    "duration": 8.907916666666667,
    "elapsed": 11.7
  },
  {
    "role": "kanshan",
    "index": 16,
    "text": "好，事情要从她在旧物回收站发现这台相机说起。",
    "path": "/audio/reference-voices-v1/kanshan/0d0e6ad32f072bb2.mp3",
    "duration": 4.72,
    "elapsed": 5.3
  },
  {
    "role": "kanshan",
    "index": 17,
    "text": "老板，这就是苏晚和这台相机的故事。你有什么想问的，我们可以再聊聊。",
    "path": "/audio/reference-voices-v1/kanshan/bae62dfc61759a2d.mp3",
    "duration": 6.434083333333334,
    "elapsed": 6.8
  },
  {
    "role": "kanshan",
    "index": 18,
    "text": "谢谢老板，我会把这件事告诉苏晚。那我先告辞了。",
    "path": "/audio/reference-voices-v1/kanshan/bb125348ce875281.mp3",
    "duration": 4.839708333333333,
    "elapsed": 5.2
  }
]